From 5ba63abb68886b141de9b6c0754bb4a217bf4e93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ani Thomas <aniphilip@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 12:10:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix PWA assets, XSS holes, timezone bug, and recurrence edge
 cases

Missing PWA assets (was causing 404s):
- Add manifest.json (referenced but never committed)
- Add icon-192/512, maskable, apple-touch and favicon assets,
  generated from the app's own brand gradient. Fixes the repeated
  /icon-192.png 404s, broken push-notification icons, and makes the
  app installable on Android.

Security:
- Add esc()/escJs()/safeUrl() helpers and apply across all ~20
  innerHTML render sites (calendar, tables, reports, reminder banner,
  admin user list, dropdowns). User-supplied titles/notes/names were
  previously injected unescaped.
- safeUrl() restricts attachment links to http(s), blocking
  javascript:/data: URLs. Attachment links get rel=noopener.

Correctness:
- Replace UTC toISOString().slice(0,10) with a local-timezone toDs().
  After ~7pm EST every "today" comparison shifted a day forward,
  affecting reminders, upcoming list and 30-day counts.
- Refresh TODAY/NOW on a timer and on visibilitychange so a tab left
  open overnight stops using yesterday's date.
- Clamp monthly recurrence to end-of-month: an event on the 31st now
  fires Feb 28/29, Apr 30 etc. instead of skipping those months.
- Calendar report now expands recurring series into occurrences within
  the filter window (previously only matched the series start date),
  and its member filter honours multi-member events.
- memberColor(): exact name/nickname match instead of substring
  guessing, which mis-coloured names containing another member's name.
- delEvent() now removes orphaned exception docs when deleting a series.

Robustness:
- startListeners() detaches existing snapshot listeners first, so a
  silent token refresh can't stack duplicates (double renders/notifs).
- Validate required fields in saveEvent/saveAuto/saveHome, including
  date ordering, before writing.
- Wrap all writes/deletes in try/catch with friendlyError() messages;
  failures previously showed a success toast.
- beginSave()/endSave() disable the save button mid-write to prevent
  double-submit duplicate records.
- Use set(..., {merge:true}) on edits so unknown fields aren't wiped.
- Cap uploads at 25MB, enforced in both preview and upload paths.
